  <!-- EN: whelingnorther corrosion -->
  <WNA_Corrosion.label>威灵蚀变</WNA_Corrosion.label>
  <!-- EN: An as yet unexplained fatal health condition in which victims often exhibit a unique state of melting upon death. Usually found on victims harmed by WNA rite weapons or directly attacked by Whelingnorthan.\n\nSo far hardly any methods can be used to treat this condition, what people can do is just pray and watch the condition grow worse, finally killing the victim. -->
  <WNA_Corrosion.description>一种尚未得以解明的致命健康状况，受害者在死亡时通常呈现出独特的融解状态，通常在被威灵会的仪式武器攻击或被威灵古族直接攻击的受害者身上发现.\n\n目前没有什么手段能用以应对这种健康状况，人们能做的只有一边祈祷一边看着受害者的情况逐步恶化，最终死亡。</WNA_Corrosion.description>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} is melting! -->
  <WNA_Corrosion.comps.HediffComp_SurgeryInspectable.surgicalDetectionDesc>{PAWN_nameDef} 正在融化！</WNA_Corrosion.comps.HediffComp_SurgeryInspectable.surgicalDetectionDesc>
  <!-- EN: hidden -->
  <WNA_Corrosion.stages.hidden.label>隐蔽</WNA_Corrosion.stages.hidden.label>
  <!-- EN: severe -->
  <WNA_Corrosion.stages.severe.label>严峻</WNA_Corrosion.stages.severe.label>
  <!-- EN: extreme -->
  <WNA_Corrosion.stages.extreme.label>极端</WNA_Corrosion.stages.extreme.label>
  <!-- EN: fatal -->
  <WNA_Corrosion.stages.fatal.label>致命</WNA_Corrosion.stages.fatal.label>
  
