  <!-- EN: mind controlled -->
  <WNA_MindControlEffect.label>心灵控制</WNA_MindControlEffect.label>
  <!-- EN: This pawn's mind has been seized. if the control is not permanent, he can still be saved; but if the control is <color=#7B50A7>permanent</color>, it's not likely he can still be fine. \n\nThis control is like a brand deep in the soul, killing the controller won't remove existing control. -->
  <WNA_MindControlEffect.description>此人的心智已被攫取。如果这一控制效果不是永久控制，此人尚能得救；但如果这一控制是&lt;color=#7B50A7>永久&lt;/color>的，那此人几乎不可能恢复原状。\n\n这种控制更像是思维钢印，杀死控制者并不能切断控制。</WNA_MindControlEffect.description>
  
  <!-- EN: molten -->
  <WNA_Molten.label>融解</WNA_Molten.label>
