  <!-- EN: rad-field buildup -->
  <WNA_RadEffect.label>辐射富集</WNA_RadEffect.label>
  <!-- EN: Hazardous effect of being exposed to radiation field. The special radiation field can convert the non-radioactive atoms that consisting normal tissue into radioactive isotopes, causing endogenous radiation that is difficult to eliminate. In extreme cases, the victim themselves will become a strong source of radiation. -->
  <WNA_RadEffect.description>暴露在辐射场中招致的有害后果。这种特殊的辐射场能将正常状况下稳定的原子转化成放射性同位素，导致难以消除的内源性辐射。在极端情况下，受害者本身将会变成一个新的强辐射源。</WNA_RadEffect.description>
  <!-- EN: Radiation damages can be found in {PAWN_nameDef}'s body. This unusual radiation effect is turning normal tissue into radiation souces, and almost cannot naturally expire. -->
  <WNA_RadEffect.comps.HediffComp_SurgeryInspectable.surgicalDetectionDesc>{PAWN_nameDef}体内有明显的辐射损伤迹象。这种特殊的辐射场正在把正常组织转化成放射源，几乎无法自然消除。</WNA_RadEffect.comps.HediffComp_SurgeryInspectable.surgicalDetectionDesc>
  <!-- EN: minor -->
  <WNA_RadEffect.stages.minor.label>轻微</WNA_RadEffect.stages.minor.label>
  <!-- EN: obvious -->
  <WNA_RadEffect.stages.obvious.label>显著</WNA_RadEffect.stages.obvious.label>
  <!-- EN: severe -->
  <WNA_RadEffect.stages.severe.label>严峻</WNA_RadEffect.stages.severe.label>
  
  <!-- EN: toxin buildup -->
  <WNA_ScrapBuildup.label>毒物蓄积</WNA_ScrapBuildup.label>
  <!-- EN: Multiple toxic and hazardous compounds accumulate in this person's body. Given that the compounds are difficult to metabolize, this health condition will lead to long-term health risks. Can lead to lethal accute total organ failure if this condition continue to develop. -->
  <WNA_ScrapBuildup.description>复数种有毒有害物质在此人体内富集。考虑到此类物质难以代谢，这一健康状况将导致长期的疾病风险。如果这一情况持续恶化，将会引发致命的急性全身器官衰竭。</WNA_ScrapBuildup.description>
  <!-- EN: Multiple toxic and hazardous compounds accumulates in {PAWN_nameDef}'s body. This condition is hard to handle, long-term medical care is suggested. -->
  <WNA_ScrapBuildup.comps.HediffComp_SurgeryInspectable.surgicalDetectionDesc>复数种有毒有害物质正在{PAWN_nameDef}体内富集. 这种状况很难治疗，需要进行长期医疗看护。</WNA_ScrapBuildup.comps.HediffComp_SurgeryInspectable.surgicalDetectionDesc>
